    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents the visual properties of a mesh material. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores material color, diffuse texture, displacement map, displacement strength, and lighting configuration. Materials define the surface properties used when rendering a mesh. </para>
